OL,3,GNEWSALong delays on M25 after crash and
OL,4,Afuel spillage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are delays of more than an hour
OL,7,Fand congestion spanning six miles on
OL,8,Fthe M25 in Surrey after three lanes
OL,9,Fwere closed following a crash and fuel
OL,10,Fspillage.
OL,12,FNational Highways said the delays were
OL,13,Fon the clockwise carriageway between
OL,14,Fjunction 12 (Thorpe) and junction 13
OL,15,F(Staines). The agency said emergency
OL,16,Fservices were currently at the scene.
OL,18,FA lorry and motorbike were involved in
OL,19,Fthe crash, travel site Inrix said.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
