OL,3,GNEWSALong delays on M25 after crash and
OL,4,Afuel spillage
OL,5,
OL,6,FInrix says congestion is stretching
OL,7,Fback to Junction 10 at Wisley on the
OL,8,FA3, with queues also extending to the
OL,9,Fnorthbound M3.
